{{!
    O atalho entre aulas: anterior, onde estou, proxima.

    E o que SOBRA quando o aluno esconde as laterais, e por isso ele fica grudado
    no topo do miolo. Na ponta o botao simplesmente nao existe - botao
    desabilitado, ou que leva para a propria aula, e pior que a ausencia dele.

    ARMADILHA: nao escreva chaves duplas de mustache dentro deste comentario.

    @template format_ldg/local/content/lessonnav
    @author    LeoDG <callme@leodg.dev>
    @copyright 2026 LeoDG <callme@leodg.dev>
    @license   http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasnav - Se ha o que navegar
    * hasprev, prev - Aula anterior, com name e url
    * hasnext, next - Proxima aula, com name e url
    * position - index, total, module e label

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasnav": true,
        "hasprev": true,
        "prev": {"name": "Aula 1", "url": "#"},
        "hasnext": true,
        "next": {"name": "Aula 3", "url": "#"},
        "position": {"index": 2, "total": 5, "module": "Modulo 2", "label": "Aula 2 de 5"}
    }
}}
{{#hasnav}}
    <nav class="ldg-lessonnav" aria-label="{{#str}}lessonnav, format_ldg{{/str}}">
        {{#hasprev}}
            <a class="ldg-lessonnav__side ldg-lessonnav__side--prev" href="{{{prev.url}}}"
               title="{{#str}}lessonprev, format_ldg{{/str}}: {{prev.name}}">
                <span class="ldg-lessonnav__dir">{{#str}}lessonprev, format_ldg{{/str}}</span>
                <span class="ldg-lessonnav__name">{{prev.name}}</span>
            </a>
        {{/hasprev}}
        {{^hasprev}}
            {{! Espaco vazio para o indicador nao pular de lugar na primeira aula. }}
            <span class="ldg-lessonnav__side" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{/hasprev}}

        <span class="ldg-lessonnav__position">
            <span class="ldg-lessonnav__count">{{position.label}}</span>
            <span class="ldg-lessonnav__module">{{position.module}}</span>
        </span>

        {{#hasnext}}
            <a class="ldg-lessonnav__side ldg-lessonnav__side--next" href="{{{next.url}}}"
               title="{{#str}}lessonnext, format_ldg{{/str}}: {{next.name}}">
                <span class="ldg-lessonnav__dir">{{#str}}lessonnext, format_ldg{{/str}}</span>
                <span class="ldg-lessonnav__name">{{next.name}}</span>
            </a>
        {{/hasnext}}
        {{^hasnext}}
            <span class="ldg-lessonnav__side" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{/hasnext}}
    </nav>
{{/hasnav}}
